it fixes the gog-client[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]reuse failure, owns a sign-in flow that cannot hang, explains every[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Google screen in plain words, recovers from the usual Cloud Console[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]mistakes in place, and renders a calm, beautiful step transcript.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]gcal_login_redesign.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/gcal_login_redesign.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-eg[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-eg/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fix client reuse and make the OAuth client step robust[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]client[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]client: normalize gog's stored client JSON and pipe it to `gog auth [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]credentials set -`, skip keyring-held clients, validate `-c` files, let [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`-c` replace a stored client, and make fake gog reject what real gog [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rejects.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob-owned sign-in through gog's two-step remote flow[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]signin[dim] · [dim][/dim]after client[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]signin: replace the inherited-stdio `gog auth add` with gog's remote [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]step 1/2, a loopback listener plus browser opener, a validated paste [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prompt, flow auto-selection, a success page, and the new step renderer.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Guided setup, account choice, self-healing check, and summary[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]experience[dim] · [dim][/dim]after signin[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]experience: guided client setup with ~/Downloads discovery, the account [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]picker and shared resolver, self-healing stale grants, the in-place [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Calendar-API retry, the summary, additive JSON fields, and doctor [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]alignment.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Help text, docs, and the final gate[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after experience[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: rewrite login help and environment text, regenerate CLI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]references, update the gcal contract, guide, and JSON/getting-started [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tables, and run the full gates.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-eg","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-eg.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-cd0bd5be48dadc0a4b3a0723954223c7","started_at":"2026-10-30T13:47:19.578303+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-eg","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-eg.1","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-eg.2","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-eg.3","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-eg.4","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-eg.land"]}
